From 9ed69ccde5397c11d3d960255d7fffcedeb48122 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:41:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add model pages (SK, SBM) with results, backlinks and a
 models index

- _models/ collection: one page per model at /models/<name>/, using the post layout
  (same fonts, MathJax macros, contents sidebar)
- Each model page lists the notes that link to it, found automatically
- /models/ lists all models with how many notes mention each; linked from the homepage
- Results are boxes with an id, so posts can link to one result; the linked box is outlined
- Fix: <body> was closed right after it opened in the post layout
- Fix: footer spacing (the .article rule was overriding it); extra room at the end in preview
- follow-edits.js only restores the scroll position after a refresh, not when following a link

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015sajfvtPmGkb5ceTztqXFY
